{
  "feature": "Analysis tab, consolidated \u2014 PR B, the tab with a current reading",
  "note": "The tab body before and with a reading (Analysis tab handoff \u00a72). Needs a server with ANALYSIS_TAB_ENABLED=true and four decks the signed-in account owns: ANALYSIS_EMPTY_DECK with NO stored reading (the empty state; on local-dev d0000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000d5b1), and three WITH one, because a stored reading draws on open with no press: ANALYSIS_DECK (d\u2026cafe), ANALYSIS_SPLIT_DECK, a range left unanswered (d\u2026d5a2), and ANALYSIS_LEAN_DECK, a single bracket with a lean (d\u2026c0b1). Every row reaches the tab by a PRESS, because BuilderTabs is client state and has no address. Each row scrolls to its surface, because on a phone the deck's own head fills the first screen and a cell would photograph that instead.",
  "rows": [
    {
      "id": "empty-idle",
